[{"id":4891354089,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI4wj6Q","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks nice!\n\nTwo comments to your benchmark: Some of those aren't very representative (measure ideal conditions instead of a realistic workload); i saw you had GDScript tests but scrapped them due to high variance. That's around what I'd expect to see since other costs likely outweigh this one.\n\nEspecially notable: The hashmap lookup is probably mostly bottlenecked by cache misses (cold lookups); hot hashmap lookups I would expect to be quite rare. It's hard to test this, but anyway your PR doesn't change this so it's not a regression.\n\nOverall i think this is a nice improvement and it matches my understanding of what bottlenecks the hot path, and it looks correct so I think this is mergable.\n\nJust two stylistic notes.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121342#pullrequestreview-4891354089","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121342","author_ass